thLabs?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — we've shipped 50+ Shopify (Plus and standard) stores and 15+ headless commerce builds. We don't have a vendor bias. On discovery we look at your GMV, catalogue complexity, growth stage, and team composition. We've talked clients out of headless when Shopify Plus was the right choice for their stage."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What about WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "WooCommerce: cheapest entry but plateau early; common India SMB choice up to ₹1–3Cr GMV. Magento (Adobe Commerce): powerful but expensive + complex; legacy enterprise commerce. BigCommerce: solid middle ground but smaller app ecosystem than Shopify. For most modern India D2C buyers the real choice is Shopify Plus vs headless, with WooCommerce as the budget alternative for sub-₹1Cr revenue."}}]}
